The source-to-instruction definitions for AdvBench, MaliciousInstruct,
TDC2023, and Alpaca were adapted for this project. Modified behavior includes
three-column Parquet output, inferred harmful/unharmful labels,
non-adversarial flags, immutable S3 snapshots, project-specific 80/20
membership, and pooled balanced sampling. We do not reproduce the upstream
128-example cap or paper-specific train/validation/test dataset construction.

Source datasets retain the terms and attribution of their original publishers.
The upstream code license is not a blanket license for the source datasets.
